nce":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>fear (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-9-18","title":"Proverbs 9:18","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>hell Heb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-10-1","title":"Proverbs 10:1","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>foolish son A \"fool\" in Scripture is never a mentally deficient person, but rather one arrogant and self-sufficient; one who orders his life as if there were no God. See, for illustration, Luke 12:16-20. The rich man was not mentally deficient, but he was a \"fool\" because he supposed that his soul could live on the things in the barn, giving no thought to his eternal wellbeing.</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-10-27","title":"Proverbs 10:27","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>fear (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-11-5","title":"Proverbs 11:5","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>perfect (See Scofield \"1 Kings 8:61\") .</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-11-25","title":"Proverbs 11:25","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>liberal soul See; 2 Corinthians 9:6-10.</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-11-28","title":"Proverbs 11:28","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>trusteth (See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\") .</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-14-2","title":"Proverbs 14:2","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>feareth (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\") .</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-14-26","title":"Proverbs 14:26","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>fear Also; Proverbs 15:16, (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\") .</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-14-27","title":"Proverbs 14:27","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>fear (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\") .</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-15-11","title":"Proverbs 15:11","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>hell Heb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\") , Job 26:6; Psalms 139:8.</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-15-16","title":"Proverbs 15:16","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>fear Also; Proverbs 14:26, (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\") .</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-15-24","title":"Proverbs 15:24","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>hell Heb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-15-33","title":"Proverbs 15:33","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>fear (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\") .</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-16-1","title":"Proverbs 16:1","author":"C. I. Scofield (1843–1921)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>fear (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\") .</p>"},{"id":"scofield-pro-16-20","title":"Proverbs 16:20","author":"C